        "description": {
          "text": "Added a reduced biweekly dosing regimen (1.5 mg/kg every two weeks) for patients maintaining complete response or better for at least 6 months",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval sBLA provides for updates to the Tecvayli (teclistamab-cqvy) US Prescribing Information and Medication Guide with a revised dosing regimen in patients who have achieved and maintained a complete response or better for a minimum of 6 months, the dosing frequency may be decreased to 1.5 mg/kg every two weeks until disease progression or unacceptable toxicity.",
